; A posting that carries both a lot price and a cost balances at its lot
; basis, so an elided posting completes to that basis.  Lot prices and
; costs teach no display precision, and nothing here writes a plain
; dollar amount, so $ has none; the gain between basis and cost must
; still keep its cents rather than be rounded to whole dollars.

2009/01/01 Buy
    Exp             10 GAL {$2.00} @@ $25.30
    Assets:Checking

2009/01/02 More gallons
    Exp             11 GAL {$2.00} @@ $25.30
    Assets:More

2009/01/03 Other cents
    Exp             10 GAL {$2.00} @@ $25.37
    Assets:Cents

2009/01/04 Lot price above the cost
    Exp             10 GAL {$3.00} @@ $25.30
    Assets:Above

2009/01/05 Lot price with cents
    Exp             10 GAL {$2.10} @@ $25.30
    Assets:Dimes

2009/01/06 Per-unit cost
    Exp             10 GAL {$2.00} @ $2.53
    Assets:PerUnit

2009/01/07 Sale
    Exp            -10 GAL {$2.00} @@ $25.30
    Assets:Sale

test reg --format '%(account)  %(quantity(amount))\n' Assets:Checking Assets:More Assets:Cents Assets:Above Assets:Dimes Assets:PerUnit Assets:Sale
Assets:Checking  -20
Assets:More  -22
Assets:Cents  -20
Assets:Above  -30
Assets:Dimes  -21
Assets:PerUnit  -20
Assets:Sale  20
end test

test bal Assets:Checking
                $-20  Assets:Checking
end test
